# I6 (Lot 1 final review): src/routeTree.gen.ts is committed on purpose,
# NOT ignored — a clean `git clone && pnpm install && pnpm typecheck`
# needs it (src/router.tsx imports it directly) and there is no standalone
# `codegen` command for it (the TanStack Router generator only runs as a
# Vite plugin, inside `vite dev`/`vite build`, not via a script this repo
# can wire into `turbo run codegen` the way `packages/backend/convex/
# _generated` is). Same ruling as that file, for a different mechanical
# reason: still regenerate it (via `pnpm dev`/`pnpm build`), never hand
# -edit it.
